flowchart TD
    A["Base program v8 approved<br/>(e.g. yearly rate-level increase)"] --> B["For each partner program on base v7:<br/>create a rebase draft on v8<br/>with the partner's own overrides carried over"]
    B --> C{"Partner overrode a value<br/>the base also changed?"}
    C -- yes --> D["Conflict flagged for review"]
    C -- no --> E["Automatic checks + backtest per program"]
    D --> E
    E --> F{"program.base_upgrade_policy"}
    F -- follow_base --> G["Included in the base approval<br/>published on the same effective date"]
    F -- manual --> H["Partner manager's queue<br/>(e.g. contractual rate lock)"]
    H --> I["Reviewed, approved and published<br/>on its own date"]
